Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:30:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 397/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0396: a stop
 during the synth wait ends the take

A Stop (toggle, controller stop, Esc, composer disabled) while the mic start waits for the priming utterance now drops the wait and ends the take, so the mic never starts afterwards. Restart, the start watchdog and a recognizer replace drop a pending wait first and never overwrite a live cancel; the wait callback bails when its recognizer was replaced. whenSynthIdle waits only for the prime utterance (tracked by a module flag cleared on its end or error) and never cancels a real reply. Adds wiring tests and a doc comment on the WebKit cloud path skipping the synth unlock.
